      "text": "xor = 0\n\nfor (int num : nums) xor = xor ^ num;\n\ni = 0\nxor = 0 ^ 1 = 1\n\ni  = 1\nxor = 1 ^ 2 = 3\n001\n010\n-----\n011\n\ni  = 2\nxor = 3 ^ 1 = 2\n011\n001\n-----\n010",
